{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は生ドルでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月、お休みしちゃったから\n生ドルが恋しかったよ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"X21さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小澤奈々花さん、田中珠里さん、籠谷さくらさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツインテール似合ってました！！\nかずおも！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、\n双子ダンスとかレンジャーゲームとか\nできて楽しかった～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"X21さんが来てくださるのは\n今日が3度目でしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"良かったらまた来てください！お待ちしてます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハコイリムスメさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鉄戸美桜さん、阿部かれんさん、神岡実希さん、 我妻桃実さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナヲとかおさわり占いとか\n生ドルの定番のものをやらせていただきましたが\nみなさんお若いから大丈夫か不安だったけど\nみなさん優しくて良かった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にあっという間でしたが\n来てくださってありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はエンディングに\n二人だけのコーナーもありましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなーり自由にやっちゃったけど\n楽しかったね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送の良さがかなり出てたと思うんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お便りもありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンケート結果は\n一意見として受け止めますね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また来月も観てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう少しでNOGIBINGO!だよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はみんな大好き妄想リクエスト！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも収録に参加してますので観てね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/28/4519058/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}